.TH "ZOXIDE" "1" "2021-04-12" "" "zoxide"
.SH NAME
\fBzoxide-edit\fR - edit the database interactively
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B zoxide edit [OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Opens the database in an interactive \fBfzf\fR(1) window, sorted by score, so
that entries can be adjusted or removed. This command requires \fBfzf\fR(1).
.sp
The following keys are available:
.TP
.B ctrl-w
Increment the score of the selected directory by 1.
.TP
.B ctrl-s
Decrement the score of the selected directory by 1.
.TP
.B ctrl-d
Delete the selected directory from the database.
.TP
.B ctrl-r
Reload the list.
.TP
.B enter
Close the window.
.PP
Changes are saved to the database as soon as they are made.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B -h, --help
Print help information.
.SH REPORTING BUGS
For any issues, feature requests, or questions, please visit:
